{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本共同社周一（11月2日）報道，東京購物商場「中野百老匯」上周四（10月29日）發生盜竊案，一隻價值約4600萬日圓（約228萬港元）的「愛彼」（Audemars Piguet）名表被偷，數天後失竊手表已被寄回店舖。</p><p>包裹附上道歉字條，甚至還有寄件人姓名，但警方認為可能是假名，正在調查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:35.394228+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:56:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T18:18:16.947769+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:38:43.351581+00:00","content_hash":"895c536c090140df3e61a5ab679ec9dcfc0d9c5d0b328fb2630b6d3790323509","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}